% ==================== CROSS-REFERENCE HELPERS ====================

% Cross-reference to instruction (creates hyperlink). PASM2-local: platform does
% not define \instrref. \chapref and \appref ARE provided by p2kb-platform-content.sty
% (identical defs) — do not redefine them here (a duplicate \newcommand is fatal).
\newcommand{\instrref}[1]{\hyperref[instr:#1]{\texttt{#1}}}

